+# fallback for graphics.texture_upscale's shader files; in a copied build that is the developer's source tree. With this
+# option ON (default) the definition is dropped, so the shaders are found only where a package puts them
+# (RECOMP_DEBUG=texup_shaders=<dir>, the user data folder, <exe dir>/shaders/upscale, <exe dir>/../share/takedawn/...);
